{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 10 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D14"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the dobutamine hydrochloride shortage on 2017-11-06 and it remains Current as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E62"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The shortage listing includes Baxter Healthcare, Hainan Poly Pharm. Co., Ltd., and Hospira, Inc. as affected companies.",
      "cites": ["E59", "E60", "E61"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our Corvale East and Corvale General inventory carries Baxter Healthcare Corporation labels with NDC 0338-1073-02.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1031233 at a Hospira plant ended 2017-10-27 and was classified VAI, 10 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1039547 at a Hospira plant ended 2018-02-02 and was classified VAI, 88 days after the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D15"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Baxter Healthcare Corporation plant (FEI 1416980) was inspected on 2026-04-02 and classified OAI.",
      "cites": ["E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to transfer 57 bags of 100 mg/100 mL, 250 mL from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would raise Corvale East from 3.1 days to 14 days on hand while Corvale General retains two weeks of supply.",
      "cites": ["D20"]
    }
  ]
}
